LL : it has nodes

N1 -> N2 -> N3

Types: 
1. SIngly LL : means where we have connection in a single direction only


2.Doubly LL :  here we have two pointers(P1,P2) unlice singly where the node has single pointer(P1)

so P1 connects to previous node and P2 connects to the next node hence this is a bidirectional

3.Circular Singly LL : 

when the last node is connected to the first node so it becomes a circular LL so from last  node we are able to access 1st node

4.Circular Doubly LL: here also first node connected to last node and last node connected to first node.



